comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-17T10:45:26.373Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: latest all-status full corpus plus request-specific searches for 1489 and all projection, open and in-progress lists, and the complete GitHub issue/comments show no canonical item for this newly reported defect. Reuse the existing read-context parent and implement in PR 1490 with related items rather than create a separate PR."
  "2026-10-17T10:51:47.670Z","harness:codex","The independent real-CLI test fails before the fix specifically because all-status selection returns projection.mode full with fields null instead of the invoked list brief contract. Applying the SDK-declared default for the original command, rather than its status-derived family alias, fixes all/draft/canceled filters without changing raw SDK defaults. PM-linked verification passes 55/55 tests across real CLI reads and command registration: both all-status spellings select open plus closed work, explicit fields/compact/full remain authoritative, sort fields remain visible, and full strict reads restore historical descriptions. Initial fixture-setup failures are excluded from negative-control evidence."
